.ct-phone.duo-app--timeline.ct-phone-grouped .ct-phone-glass, .ct-phone.duo-app--timeline.ct-phone-grouped .ct-phone-body, .ct-phone.duo-app--timeline.ct-phone-grouped .ct-phone-home-control,
